{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "23f2dd92-5f48-45d2-8d27-540823de0438",
    "name": "Productivity Graveyard",
    "description": "Welcome to the official API for **Productivity Graveyard** — the final resting place for your abandoned side projects, half-baked ideas, and over-scoped ambitions.\n\nThis collection provides all endpoints needed to:\n\n- Bury (create) a dead project\n    \n- Upvote hilariously tragic eulogies & Projects\n    \n- View global stats like _Dev Hope Half-Life_ and _Funerals Today_\n    \n- Resurrect a project (if you dare)\n    \n- Comment, roast, or leave fake flowers\n    \n- Handle user authentication with JWT\n    \n\nAll requests and responses follow a consistent structure for easy parsing and validation. Authenticated routes require a valid JWT in the `Authorization` header (`Bearer token`).\n\n####   \n**Response Formats**  \n  \nSuccessful response:\n\n``` javascript\n{ \n  \"success\": true,\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"statusCode\": 200,\n  \"message\": \"Project found\",\n  \"data\": [ { \"id\": 1, \"title\": \"Project 1\" }, { \"id\": 2, \"title\": \"Project 2\" } ],\n  \"meta\": \n    { \"total\": 200, \n      \"offset\": 20, \n      \"limit\": 10 \n      \"hasNext\": true \n    } \n}\n\n ```\n\n#### For validation errors:\n\n``` javascript\n{\n \"success\": false,\n  \"status\": \"bad request\",\n  \"statusCode\": 400,\n  \"message\": \"Validation failed\",\n  \"errors\": [\n    {\n      \"field\": \"title\",\n      \"type\": \"required\",\n      \"message\": \"Title is a required field\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"field\": \"eulogy\",\n      \"type\": \"max\",\n      \"message\": \"Eulogy must be 300 characters or fewer\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n ```\n\nFrontend can map errors\\[n\\].field to form input names for validation rendering.\n\n####   \nFor other errors\n\n``` javascript\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"statusCode\": 404,\n  \"message\": \"Project not found\"\n}\n\n ```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "34014473"
  },
